  "label": "Cat self-awareness stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that cats are self-aware and can be portrayed as having human-like thoughts or behaviors, even if they are absurd. The cat's smug expression and the text 'i washed my paws in the toilet bowl after i used the litterbox' imply that the cat is aware of its own 'dirty' behavior and is defending itself. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is required to understand the humor.",
